{"v":1,"id":"sika-dilatec-er-350","n":"Sika Dilatec ER-350","b":"Sika","u":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/waterproofing/66807/sika-dilatec-er-350.html","c":"construction/waterproofing/66807","d":{"t":"PVC multifunctional sealing tape for PVC membranes","s":"Sika Dilatec ER-350 is a flexible waterproofing tape based on polyvinyl chloride (PVC) with advanced adhesion properties. The tape terminates and connects Sikaplan WP (PVC) sheet membranes onto concrete or metal substrates. The E-edge on one side of the tape is bonded to concrete or metal with Sikadur epoxy adhesives. The R-edge on the other side is hot air welded to the Sikaplan WP membranes. Thickness 1,6 mm. Part of the Sika Dilatec joint sealing system.","a":["Multifunctional solution for sealing PVC membranes onto concrete and metal substrates","Good adhesion properties","No activation on site required","High flexibility and joint bridging ability","Good chemical resistance","Root penetration resistant","Hot air weldable","Adaptable to many different jointing situations"],"us":["Sealing of different structures and applications including:","Bridges","Basements","Cut and cover tunnels","Sealing of:","Connections between PVC waterproofing membranes onto concrete or metal substrates","Construction joints","Terminations"],"pk":"1 roll, 20 m length Refer to current price list for packaging variations","sec":[{"l":"APPROVALS / CERTIFICATES","t":"Material Properties Sika Dilatec ER-350, tecnotest ag, Test report No. A4020-05","g":"Sustainability / Certifications / Approvals"},{"l":"Composition","t":"PVC, bitumen compatible (PVC-P-BV)","g":"Product Information"},{"l":"Shelf life","t":"36 months from date of production","g":"Product Information"},{"l":"Storage conditions","t":"The product must be stored in original, unopened and undamaged sealed packaging in dry conditions at temperatures between +5 °C and +30 °C. Opened and unprotected rolls must be used within 2 months. Always refer to packaging.","g":"Produc